      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7517255::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ta3C and Nb3C formation may improve the mechanical performance of the carbon-doped alloy.",
